          "start_ms": null,
          "text": "Témoignages: SAINT-HILAIRE-LEZ-CAMBRAI (59) 31.03.1975 T1 SAINT-HILAIRE-LEZ-CAMBRAI (59) 31.03.1975 T2",
          "text_sha256": "0485b197354568d1f41335fbf89f596f66a1be21ceb57c8479f800cdb802a7ff"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
